      "content": "While our core instance is the main compute hub, we can be decoupled from infrastructure costs by utilizing edge computing, local instances (e.g., a lightweight container), or third-party optimization platforms. These alternatives would allow us to maintain our optimization capabilities without incurring full compute costs. Some edge cases may require some level of integration with the existing infrastructure, but in general, our \"intelligence\" can be adapted to leaner infrastructure requirements.",
